# plugin-pokemon-tcg

- Package: `@poke-emdash/plugin-pokemon-tcg`
- Plugin id and API prefix: `pokemon-tcg` → `/_emdash/api/plugins/pokemon-tcg/...`
- Export: `pokemonTcgPlugin()`
- Admin widget id: `pokemon-shortcuts`
- Keep PT block type keys (`pokemonDecklist`, `pokemonCard`, …) stable unless migrating content.
- Allowed hosts: `api.tcgdex.net`, `pokeapi.co`
